{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"states\": [\n    {\n      \"shot\": 1,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他想起过去自然亲近的日子，心里重新暖起来，也有了劲头，想把往后的日子过好。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"怀念、温暖、盼望、振奋\",\n      \"missed\": \"他之后仍然担心孤单、不知道何时再有人亲近；以及即使一直没有，也决定不再为了留住谁而咽下委屈。这两层需要逐句读第三、四条才能抓到。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    },\n    {\n      \"shot\": 2,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他被过去亲近的回忆重新点起劲头，开始想往前走，好好过日子，不再跟过去较劲。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"温暖、兴奋、振奋、向前冲\",\n      \"missed\": \"兴奋之后还会出现对孤单的担忧，最终也要面对可能一直没有人亲近自己的现实。后两条的转折和最终态度仍然需要细读。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    },\n    {\n      \"shot\": 3,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他从怀念过去、重新振作，逐渐转为平静和下定决心：以后有人亲近就好好珍惜，没有也要自己好好生活。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"怀念、兴奋、迟疑、平静、释然、决心\",\n      \"missed\": \"他对未来关系是否牢固的疑问，以及不再为了留住谁而咽下委屈这一具体决定，不一定能在一眼中完整抓到，需要读第四条长句。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    }\n  ],\n  \"score\": 3,\n  \"link\": 3,\n  \"main_problem\": \"四条主句都比较长，而且视觉权重接近，容易让人不知道先抓哪一条。第一、二条的回暖和振奋比较容易扫到，但第三条的孤单与疑问、第四条的最终决定需要更多阅读时间。逐渐出现的短语确实贴着各自的事件，能帮助把情绪和处境连起来，尤其第三张的情绪变化比较完整；但下方音符动画主要提供音乐氛围，没有明确对应人物的具体处境。整体能串成一条情绪变化的线，但最后的自我选择还不够容易一眼抓住。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "cfa70a76-a9ae-48e3-a5ed-2c29b5b3dfb1", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T004909442792Z", "elapsed_seconds": 82.453, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T00:50:31.894152+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "a9c3fc39b990e8018c3ee9ed463a7fa8022b5243416b03052f3b67f084f3e485", "attachment_count": 3}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 3, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T004909442792Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "b73d8f03a640221f1ef144435abd9a914ea4377b1dff46f5665280432b81b3fd"}}}
